{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c82510ade1b33ff6ef05d98074cea14fb55b58978b25a49dd9f75d26e5deaaa7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34129c2258c571445e003de37235387cfe9546c3ca05295b04e3488bec78db3f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d085377cb02cbad576628def0ee60256c207b53ddb8196e421c9b1deee9c0dc6",
      "text": "今天的演唱会，还有视频拍摄，\n都能顺利成功，真的太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d508d19b6e7963cd68f0db13d12d858d9572816ea1c99a300f8df88dc165e81",
      "text": "回想起来从一开始打招呼起，\n我们成员之间的默契就超级合拍呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b396db477f539991df817a84358ba190b0914856ca3553c4835249fcb8b38c2f",
      "text": "虽然和春名君因为蛋糕和甜甜圈的事，\n不知不觉就激动争执起来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb76295928661497027249d7c9ea603b13b75c53c453174b5285c98fd024429",
      "text": "但最后还是结成了甜品同盟，\n我觉得真是太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed1cf7e5ceec672310046ca85717aad1afb56570d48e19b58de38c858a9ce506",
      "text": "……啊，对了！\n我也一直想跟制作人说呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad010f3d0f0bd730ca08174e031c3dda413bd761332de86ff4da54011d292267",
      "text": "虽然在LINK上也跟您提过了，\n要不要加入甜品同盟呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:589ce584db7af6f9a8755ec827548bb1f35bf9fb249041586057b03329064536",
      "text": "啊，顺便说一句什么时候答复都\n可以的，希望能考虑一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9efcdc9e73843e2aaaa25362b2af7bb1501b638654a011f88aed0f5508cff4d4",
      "text": "好的！谢谢您的\n邀请",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_304_2_3_030_04_09_a:2_3_030_04_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:669074a374109559ef91ea84bc517bf2a3b74e32dfaf419fb75665fd36467a4d",
      "text": "我才要谢谢您呢！\n之后再联系哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
